  "body": "Found during #2201 (PR #2652).\n\nAfter the path line cache, `frame/collect` still takes about 2.7-4 ms for each frame with an 8114-move path shown or selected. The named spans in `collect` add up to about 1 ms only.\n\nLikely causes (not measured one by one):\n- `path_overlay::toolpath_lines` copies the cached lines into a new vector.\n- `interact::collect_overlay` and `world::collect_overlay` copy that vector again, and each calls `capped`.\n- `world::world_verts_by` clones the cached model vertices on each frame.\n\nExpected: add spans to find the cost, then keep the overlay as shared slices (for example `Arc` parts) so that a still frame copies nothing. Keep the counter tests of crates/ui/AGENTS.md \"Frame cost\".\n",
